This package includes an adapted rustls-rustcrypto implementation from
https://github.com/RustCrypto/rustls-rustcrypto at revision
70f76c039e587192688af18a80d5d6435dedaf22.

The upstream implementation is distributed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. Its
original license texts and copyright notice are retained in LICENSE-MIT
and LICENSE-APACHE. Adaptations include current dependency constraints,
explicit macro identifiers, identity admission, bounded public RSA decoding,
X25519 contributory checks, fallible entropy handling and AEAD corrections.

Independent TLS/certificate backends are used only by development tests.
